<html>
<head>
	<title></title>
</head>
<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;">Ref No: {{{Case.Case_Number__c}}}<br />
<br />
Hi {{{Case.First_Name__c}}},<br />
<br />
Thank you for contacting the Qantas Customer Care team.
<p>While we do try to meet every customer's seating preference, sometimes we need to rearrange the seating for operational, safety or security reasons, even after boarding the aircraft. We're sorry that we are no longer able to offer your pre-selected seat on&nbsp;{{{Case.Flight_Number__c}}}.<br />
<br />
We do our best to re-book you to a similar seat, but unfortunately, we are unable to guarantee that the new seat will be exactly where you'd like it to be.<br />
<br />
<strong><em>If refunding fee, add:</em></strong><br />
<strong>We've requested your refund</strong><br />
The <em><strong>&lt;insert type of fee&gt;</strong></em> will be refunded back to the original form of payment in approximately 7 business days.<br />
<br />
<em><strong>-If offering goodwill gesture due to tier of Frequent Flyer:-</strong></em><br />
As a gesture of goodwill, I’ve credited {{{Case.Recovery_Quantity__c}}} Qantas Points to your Frequent Flyer account.<br />
<br />
<em><strong>-If not a Frequent Flyer: -</strong></em><br />
As a gesture of goodwill, I’d like to arrange a credit of {{{Case.Recovery_Quantity__c}}} Qantas Points to you.<br />
Please can you let me know your Frequent Flyer number by replying to this email so I can credit points to your account. If you’re not already a member you can use this <a href="https://www.qantas.com/en-au/frequent-flyer/join/code/familyfree">link</a>&nbsp;to join free of charge.<br />
<br />
<strong>We value your opinion</strong><br />
Customer feedback plays an important role in our continuous improvement process so that we can provide you with exceptional service from start to finish.<br />
&nbsp;<br />
I want to assure you that I've passed your comments on to the relevant team for review.<br />
&nbsp;<br />
Thank you for taking the time to let us know about your experience and we look forward to welcoming you onboard again soon.</p>
</body>
</html>